WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.659
The third answer is an alternative
path: move the workload to a

2
00:00:03.659 --> 00:00:07.763
different certified service, and
leave the identity plane where it is.

3
00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:12.104
Google Workspace and Gemini for Government
are separate listings at different

4
00:00:12.104 --> 00:00:14.566
classes, so which AI
features sit inside which

5
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:16.963
certification is a
question for the package.

6
00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:19.428
The public record shows one such move:

7
00:00:19.428 --> 00:00:23.644
in September 2025 a cabinet-level
department signed a five-year

8
00:00:23.644 --> 00:00:28.337
