before a temporary discount expired.

9
00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:31.362
Google puts it at more
than 50,000 employees.

10
00:00:31.362 --> 00:00:34.863
Whichever way you go, keep
Entra ID as the source.

11
00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:39.349
Provision users, federate sign-in
and apply Conditional Access there.

12
00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:43.975
Then close the gaps: Google super
administrators sign in outside it,

13
00:00:43.975 --> 00:00:47.362
and Google's directory is
derived, so report drift.

14
00:00:47.362 --> 00:00:49.080
Next, the evidence.
